The GitHub app accepted all 24 production/test/documentation blobs, but tree
creation and commit creation returned GitHub HTTP 403 API rate-limit errors.
A normal direct-main Git push had no transport credentials. This archive was
therefore saved through the working GitHub Contents API rather than publishing
a partially updated checksum generation.

